prompt:
Build a premium marketing website for the brief below. It should look and feel like a top-tier, award-winning site, with high-quality motion and animation throughout.

Brief: {brief}

Deliver a static site in the current directory: index.html plus any CSS/JS files it needs, no build step. You may load Google Fonts and libraries from a CDN (cdnjs, jsdelivr or unpkg). Do not use external or stock images; create visuals with HTML, CSS, SVG or canvas. When you are finished, reply with a short summary of what you built.
